# Live, runtime-mutable captcha encryption state. The sidecar encrypts from
# encrypt_meta.json and the analyzer rewrites both files on every run, so they
# must NOT be version-controlled: a pull could clobber live state with a stale
# committed algorithm (instant 400) or leave them root-owned. The immutable,
# content-addressed corpus under bundles/ stays tracked as a backup/test fixture.
/storage/app/captcha/ivac-bundle.js
/storage/app/captcha/encrypt_meta.json

# Claude Code local settings — machine-specific approved-command cache. It
# accumulates whatever gets approved, which has included live credentials
# (SSH passwords, API keys), so it must never be version-controlled.
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/settings.local.json.tmp.*

# dg-epay checkout HAR captures — ~190MB and they hold live session cookies,
# wallet PINs and OTPs. Research artefacts, kept local only.
/tests/*.har
/tests/har-data/
